From: Fabrizio Catitti <fabrizio.catitti@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:43:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(voice): year/type hints for "play", honest
 next-episode results

- Resolver parses a trailing year ("dune 2021", "dune del 2021") and a
  leading type ("il film", "la serie", "the movie", "the series") from the
  spoken title, searches both the bare and full text, and ranks with year
  (+50/-50, series match any year they ran) and type (+20/-60) adjustments.
  Titles ending in or made of a number still match exactly.
- Alexa says the year of the title it opened.
- Next episode mirrors playNextEpisode's silent early returns (not loaded,
  not aired, watch-party lock, countdown running) and reports when Manual
  auto-play opens the source list instead of starting playback.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQ7oit84w6xrrRhN57hYZw
